# Linear SVM Classification

- When two classes can be separated by a line (hyperplane). Figure \ref{fig:ch05-1-large-margin-classification}, left
  - They are **linearly separable**
- SVM classifier fits the widest possible street. Figure \ref{fig:ch05-1-large-margin-classification}, right
  - This is called **large margin classification**

\begin{figure}
\includegraphics[scale=0.33]{figures/ch05-1-large-margin-classification}
\caption{Large margin classification \parencite[pg.287]{geron-2023}}
\label{fig:ch05-1-large-margin-classification}
\end{figure}

